Code
----
- DiffSynth-Studio (video diffusion pipeline, LoRA training)
  https://github.com/modelscope/DiffSynth-Studio  — Apache-2.0
- Wan2.1 / VACE (video diffusion backbone and context adapter)
  https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.1, https://github.com/ali-vilab/VACE — Apache-2.0
- DWPose (whole-body pose estimation; ONNX inference code vendored under
  third_party/dwpose/ from the ControlNet-v1-1-nightly annotator)
  https://github.com/IDEA-Research/DWPose
  https://github.com/lllyasviel/ControlNet-v1-1-nightly — Apache-2.0
- Video-Depth-Anything (video depth estimation; cloned by scripts/setup_models.sh)
  https://github.com/DepthAnything/Video-Depth-Anything — Apache-2.0 (code)
- SAM 3 (promptable video segmentation)
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam3 — SAM License
- SAM 2 + Grounding DINO (fallback segmenter)
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2 — Apache-2.0
  https://github.com/IDEA-Research/GroundingDINO — Apache-2.0

Model weights (downloaded, not redistributed here)
--------------------------------------------------
- Wan-AI/Wan2.1-VACE-1.3B (DiT, VAE, umT5 encoder) — Apache-2.0
- DWPose ONNX weights (yolox_l.onnx, dw-ll_ucoco_384.onnx; HF yzd-v/DWPose) — Apache-2.0
- Video-Depth-Anything ViT-Large weights — CC-BY-NC-4.0 (NON-COMMERCIAL).
  The ViT-Small weights are Apache-2.0; see README "License" for the
  --depth_encoder vits alternative.
- facebook/sam3 weights — SAM License (gated access on Hugging Face)
- SAM 2.1 hiera-tiny weights — Apache-2.0
- IDEA-Research/grounding-dino-tiny weights — Apache-2.0
- Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct (optional --auto_caption) — Apache-2.0

Data
----
- The released LoRA weights were trained on videos and captions from the
  HOIGen-1M dataset. HOIGen-1M itself is not redistributed here; see its
  terms for dataset usage.
